`yes` is a boolean under the YAML 1.1 resolver the readers use, so the word given as text is
written single-quoted and reloads as the string it was.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md summary=yes
-- exit --
0
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: summary=yes
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
summary: 'yes'
---
# Body
